{"id":59226,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":""},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:41:11","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:41:11","slug":"sao-silvestre-vitor-baptista","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-vitor-baptista\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026<\/strong> (6\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">12 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, na vila da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> (distrito de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lisboa<\/strong>), com partida e chegada na <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Pra\u00e7a Jos\u00e9 M\u00e1ximo da Costa<\/strong>, junto aos Pa\u00e7os do Concelho. O programa desportivo inicia-se \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">16:30<\/strong> com a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria<\/strong>, prossegue das <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">16:35 \u00e0s 17:25<\/strong> com as <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Provas Jovens<\/strong> e culmina \u00e0s <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">18:00<\/strong> com o tiro de partida conjunto da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km<\/strong> e da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6 km<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Na capital portuguesa dos dinossauros, o circuito urbano percorre as art\u00e9rias iluminadas da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> (1 volta para os <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">6 km<\/strong> e 2 voltas para os <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">10 km<\/strong>, com tempo limite de <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">2h30<\/strong>). J\u00e1 a <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria de 6 km<\/strong> (guiada) une desporto, patrim\u00f3nio e tradi\u00e7\u00e3o gastron\u00f3mica, terminando com uma visita especial \u00e0 <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Adega Cooperativa da Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> para degusta\u00e7\u00e3o da emblem\u00e1tica <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Tarte Dona Isabel<\/strong> (Doce Lourinh\u00e3) e da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Aguardente DOC Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong>, revertendo o contributo solid\u00e1rio para uma institui\u00e7\u00e3o do concelho.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pela <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o V\u00edtor Baptista<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">C\u00e2mara Municipal da Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong>, da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Junta de Freguesia da Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> e homologa\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica da <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Lisboa (AAL)<\/strong>, a prova garante sopa quente de oferta no final, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o, pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios para o Top 10 geral M\/F dos 10 km e entradas para o <strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Dino Parque \/ Brickopolis Lourinh\u00e3<\/strong> para os 4 primeiros classificados dos escal\u00f5es jovens (Benjamins a Iniciados). Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">12 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 25