x; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase:<\/strong> 15,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (19\/11 a 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria (6 km)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 16:30<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00danica:<\/strong> 10,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Provas Jovens (Benjamins A\/B, Sub-14, Sub-16 e Sub-18)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 16:35<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Escal\u00f5es Jovens:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 06\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a 6\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, na Pra\u00e7a Jos\u00e9 M\u00e1ximo da Costa, na Lourinh\u00e3. A Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria (6 km) parte \u00e0s 16:30, as Provas Jovens (Benjamins A a Sub-18) decorrem entre as 16:35 e as 17:25, e a S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km e Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6 km partem em conjunto \u00e0s 18:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Para os 10 km e Mini 6 km, a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o custa 10,00 \u20ac na 1\u00aa fase (at\u00e9 19 de julho), 13,00 \u20ac na 2\u00aa fase (19 de julho a 18 de novembro) e 15,00 \u20ac na 3\u00aa fase (19 de novembro a 6 de dezembro). A Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria (6 km) tem o valor \u00fanico de 10,00 \u20ac, enquanto as Provas Jovens e atletas de Desporto Adaptado t\u00eam inscri\u00e7\u00e3o 100% gratuita.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rio funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no pr\u00f3prio dia da prova (s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026), na Pra\u00e7a Jos\u00e9 M\u00e1ximo da Costa (junto \u00e0 C\u00e2mara Municipal da Lourinh\u00e3), entre as 12:00 e as 17:00 (o levantamento da t-shirt da caminhada decorre das 12:00 \u00e0s 16:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria e o kit dos atletas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todos os atletas dos 10 km e 6 km t\u00eam direito a kit de atleta, medalha de participa\u00e7\u00e3o e sopa de oferta no final (equipas com mais de 8 atletas recebem 1 dorsal de oferta). A Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria inclui t-shirt oficial e termina com visita \u00e0 Adega Cooperativa da Lourinh\u00e3 e degusta\u00e7\u00e3o da Tarte Dona Isabel e Aguardente DOC Lourinh\u00e3.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e trof\u00e9us atribu\u00eddos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Nos 10 km s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios e meias t\u00e9cnicas Prevent Sprain aos 10 primeiros da geral M\/F (125 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 100 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 75 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba at\u00e9 ao 10\u00ba lugar), al\u00e9m de medalhas aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o (Sub-20 a Vet 80+) e trof\u00e9us \u00e0s 3 melhores equipas. Nas Provas Jovens, os 4 primeiros de Benjamins a Iniciados recebem ainda 1 entrada para o Dino Parque \/ Brickopolis Lourinh\u00e3.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-12\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Lourinh\u00e3, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lourinh\u00e3\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A 6\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026 realiza-se a 12 de dezembro na Lourinh\u00e3. Corrida de 10 km, Mini 6 km, Caminhada Solid\u00e1ria e Jovens. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/08\/imagem.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km (2 voltas)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt\/Competicoes\/891\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6 km (1 volta)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt\/Competicoes\/891\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria (6 km)\", \"price\": \"10.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt\/Competicoes\/891\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Provas Jovens (Benjamins A\/B, Sub-14, Sub-16 e Sub-18)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/competicoes.aalisboa.com.pt\/Competicoes\/891\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a 6\u00aa S\u00e3o Silvestre V\u00edtor Baptista 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 12 de dezembro de 2026, na Pra\u00e7a Jos\u00e9 M\u00e1ximo da Costa, na Lourinh\u00e3. A Caminhada Rota Urbana Solid\u00e1ria (6 km) parte \u00e0s 16:30, as Provas Jovens (Benjamins A a Sub-18) decorrem entre as 16:35 e as 17:25, e a S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km e Mini S\u00e3o Silvestre 6 km partem em conjunto \u00e0s 18:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u0